{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to survive, craft and build the essentials, find source of food and construct necessary shelter before the snow starts falling. And may be someday, after building a bridge, you will find your way back home. Keep building bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASIC SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic survival is building a fire for heat and warmth to keep from freezing to death. This is essential for heat as well as for cooking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.poster.avif?t=1768572989\" aria-label=\"character grabbing and combining rock, stick, log to craft a fire\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.webm?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.mp4?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice too the blinking hunger bar with the drumstick icon. It is up to you to explore and find food.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING SHELTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover sources of sustainable food you can begin to collect materials for building shelter. Structures help you to keep warm, store food properly, and tan hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.poster.avif?t=1768572989\" aria-label=\"dragging a box to build sections of structures\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.webm?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.mp4?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER SURVIVAL TIPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protective clothing is important and can be crafted from tanned hides, properly smoking the hides ensures that you get the best protection.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berries are a plentiful source of replenishable food though you should stock up before temperatures get too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small fur creature roaming around is a little dangerous so be careful wounds can sometimes be fatal. They love the berries and will slowly multiply.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698630?t=1768572989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698630?t=1768572989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/6c8446d5f3740222d23052820cb0ce3dfe60eee1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768572989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/6c8446d5f3740222d23052820cb0ce3dfe60eee1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768572989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to survive, craft and build the essentials, find source of food and construct necessary shelter before the snow starts falling. And may be someday, after building a bridge, you will find your way back home. Keep building bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BASIC SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic survival is building a fire for heat and warmth to keep from freezing to death. This is essential for heat as well as for cooking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.poster.avif?t=1768572989\" aria-label=\"character grabbing and combining rock, stick, log to craft a fire\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.webm?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/24068887391c43cd978efbe1f33d62f8.mp4?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice too the blinking hunger bar with the drumstick icon. It is up to you to explore and find food.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING SHELTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover sources of sustainable food you can begin to collect materials for building shelter. Structures help you to keep warm, store food properly, and tan hides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.poster.avif?t=1768572989\" aria-label=\"dragging a box to build sections of structures\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.webm?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/extras/3698b088d4d7f892c085a9cdf14ac00b.mp4?t=1768572989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OTHER SURVIVAL TIPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protective clothing is important and can be crafted from tanned hides, properly smoking the hides ensures that you get the best protection.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berries are a plentiful source of replenishable food though you should stock up before temperatures get too cold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small fur creature roaming around is a little dangerous so be careful wounds can sometimes be fatal. They love the berries and will slowly multiply.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Addiekin Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698630/ace9f26c12fba741df862495f53134022b9b0b42/header.jpg?t=1768572989","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Processor &gt;1ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core Processor &gt;1ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3698630/2055330202/5e2cbbb02f5f74dda91f7e27b913b3b340221bd4/1766513670/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766514826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3698630/2055330202/5e2cbbb02f5f74dda91f7e27b913b3b340221bd4/1766513670/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766514826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3698630/20553302